lse; from the cockpit of an aerobatic plane to the pyrotechnic line during airshows, under a 26 ton water drop and more!\nEAA is a community of passionate aviation enthusiasts that promotes and supports recreational flying, of all types! Offering free introductory flights through EAA Young Eagles and hosting the World\u2019s Largest Aviation Celebration in Oshkosh, WI every year.  Learn more at www.eaa.org. \n\"", "short_description": "Take flight with EAA\u2019s 360 and virtual reality videos."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.eaa.org/en/eaa/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.eaa.org/en/eaa/privacypolicy", "publisher_name": "Experimental Aircraft Association, Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.eaa.org/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EXPLORATION", "EDUCATIONAL", "MOVIE", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": [], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "419676289952632"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162706_1843189345708008_2900385758516871168_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_AQ_dxuhJFwQ7kNvwE1j2pd&_nc_oc=AdpJqakh4B_L_jcgxsSaAWjePZh-mZ_VOle1PxSicCd0Swscq1rv3ekYAw30menwKfU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f30f&oh=00_AQVGd_9h_C4vT87w3b75lSZzgwaPdmAWWgQx75aEva4-aA&oe=6B0EF6B5"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "EAA 3